#. ~ Description of monster "mon_star_vampire_coiling"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"Originally invisible, you can now see the thick coiling tentacles tipped with"
" rather flat maws that make up this creature.  The small central body is "
"dominated by an enormous mouth from which emerges a near-constant high-"
"pitched tittering."
msgstr ""

